OL,3,GNEWSAOpen more Welsh language nurseries
OL,4,Aor parents could choose English ones,
OL,5,Agroup warns
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere are no plans or targets in place
OL,8,Fto deliver Plaid Cymru's commitment to
OL,9,Fexpand the offer of free Welsh language
OL,10,Fchildcare, according to a nursery
OL,11,Fnetwork dedicated to the language.
OL,13,FCatrin Edwards, chief executive of
OL,14,FMudiad Meithrin, said she was worried
OL,15,Fthat many parents would choose English
OL,16,Flanguage childcare if provision in
OL,17,FWelsh was not available locally to
OL,18,Fthem.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,439,430,260,140,0,100
