OL,3,GNEWSAOpen more Welsh language nurseries
OL,4,Aor parents could choose English ones,
OL,5,Agroup warns
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Thursday the Plaid-run Welsh
OL,8,Fgovernment announced 19 councils will
OL,9,Foffer 12.5 hours of free childcare for
OL,10,Fall two-year-olds by the end of
OL,11,FNovember.
OL,13,FIt said that "expanding Welsh-medium
OL,14,Fchildcare is an integral part of our
OL,15,Fplans to expand funded childcare".
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
